OL,3,GNEWSABoys arrested after fire at BBC   
OL,4,Aseries community centre                
OL,6,FThree boys have been arrested on       
OL,7,Fsuspicion of arson after a fire broke  
OL,8,Fout at a disused community centre that 
OL,9,Ffeatured in the BBC series The Outlaws.
OL,11,FThe fire happened at Sea Mills         
OL,12,FCommunity Centre in Sunny Hill, Sea    
OL,13,FMills, on Tuesday evening.             
OL,15,FAvon and Somerset Police said the      
OL,16,Fbuilding was "well alight" when        
OL,17,Femergency services arrived, and        
OL,18,Fresidents of 10 neighbouring properties
OL,19,Fwere evacuated due to concerns around  
OL,20,Fasbestos. They have since returned home
OL,21,Fand no injuries were reported.         
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
