OL,3,GNEWSABoys arrested after fire at BBC   
OL,4,Aseries community centre                
OL,6,FThe arrested boys, who are all aged    
OL,7,Fbetween 13 and 16, remain in police    
OL,8,Fcustody. A cordon remains in place and 
OL,9,Fpolice have urged any witnesses to come
OL,10,Fforward.                               
